 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Not politely, no. Waiting until you' finished and the waiter has cleared your plate is the usual rule, so you don't slow everything down. Some restaurants do split the check automatically based on seats, others leave it to the group. It' worth checking before ordering. A good rule is 10% for a small table, 15 20% for a busy place. tip is separate from the bill, so don't leave it on the table. No worries.",
